          "path": "_m/w/6/7/r/don-det-wp/historic-locomotive-hosting-go.jpg",
          "filename": "Historic locomotive hosting goats in Don Khon, Si Phan Don, Laos.jpg",
          "caption": "Standing on this rusty vehicle like 3 champions upon the steps of a podium, these goats seem to have elected that old good locomotive as their territory.\nPhoto taken during a visit of Don Khon in the 4000 islands, Champassak province, Laos. In this country the captive animals are not enclosed and thus free to move in a large perimeter.\n\nThe locomotive is a historic object from the ancient Don Det–Don Khon narrow-gauge railway and constitutes a touristic place in Si Phan Don.",
